      <title>Tanzania Dam Is a Massive Moment for African Self-Finance</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-08-31/tanzania-dam-is-a-massive-moment-for-african-self-finance</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">a64fd4b9b2eeda27f35c3b4e</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 04:00:01 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Four years ago, Tanzania was so short of power that its state-run utility said electricity would be rationed, with some areas cut off for nine hours a day. But by last week, when President Samia Suluhu Hassan officially opened a giant new hydropower plant on the country’s largest river, the Rufiji, it had become a power-surplus nation.</description>
