      <title>Children Should Be More Than a Luxury</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-08-30/children-should-be-more-than-a-luxury</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">293c707e81dd569fe49ea9eb</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 18:00:01 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>It's increasingly apparent that humanity won’t be returning to levels of fertility that helped quadruple the world’s population over the past century. Wistful state programs almost guarantee disappointment, given households are getting smaller — and costlier. But some political leaders aren’t giving up yet.</description>
